      "date": "2026-05-09T19:59:36.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹57.19 (up from ₹37.62 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹875.8b (up 45% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹50.7b (up 52% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.8% (up from 5.5% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 11%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 1.9%. Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Luxury industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 18% per year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
